@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nhi-il25-nouns`
IMPORT `nhi-s14-income`
IMPORT `nhi-s14-fixed-and-benefits`

-- National Health Insurance Law, s 14 as a whole: the health insurance contribution of one insured
-- person for one calendar month. Quotations (`src:N`) are copied mechanically from line N of
-- ../../registers/source-bundle/national-health-insurance-law-5754-1994.he.wiki.txt.
--
-- THE ORDER. (g) and (g1) first: they apply "notwithstanding (b) to (f1)", so an exempt person pays
-- nothing, not even the minimum amount. Then (e): one liable under (e) is not liable under (b) to
-- (d) and (f1) ((e)(4)). Otherwise the subsection of the person's kind: (b), (c), (e1) or (f).
--
-- MONTHS. The text is read as amended at retrieval, which prints 5.17% and (f1)'s 3.23% "for
-- contributions collected for January 2025 on"; the 5.17% is dated only by an editorial note
-- (January 2025: 5.16%), and the reduced amount of (f1) is the National Insurance Law's s 341 as
-- amended in 2025 (row IL-04, fork F3), which the text of that Law has from 1 January 2026. So months
-- before 2026 are declined by name.

§ `Section 14 — the contribution for a month`

§§ `The months the text answers`

-- src:315 | (ו1) [note: (חל על דמי ביטוח בריאות הנגבים בעד חודש ינואר 2025 ואילך):] על אף האמור בסעיפים קטנים (ב) עד (ד) ו־(ה1), מעסיק החייב לשלם דמי ביטוח בריאות בעד עובד, עובד החייב בתשלום דמי ביטוח בריאות בעד עצמו ועובד עצמאי החייב בתשלום דמי ביטוח בריאות לפי אותם סעיפים קטנים, ישלמו על החלק מההכנסה שאינו עולה על הסכום המופחת שנקבע לפי סעיף 341 לחוק הביטוח הלאומי, דמי ביטוח בריאות בשיעור של 3.23%.
@ref National Health Insurance Law s 14(f1) (source line 315); National Insurance Law s 341 as amended (row IL-04 fork F3)
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the year is one this row answers` y MEANS
    y AT LEAST 2026

§§ `The contribution for the month`

-- F5: a person whose computed amount under (b), (c) or (e1) is nothing. (f) catches one "for whom no
-- health insurance contributions are payable under (b) to (e1) or (f1)", who pays the minimum amount.
-- Is a computed nothing "not payable"? The kinds for whom (b), (c) or (e1) governs and whose income
-- is nothing are the case. For (c)(2) the proviso already floors the amount at the minimum amount.
@ref National Health Insurance Law s 14(f) (source line 314); fork F5
GIVEN p IS A `A person's month under section 14`
      f IS A `The figures section 14 reads for a year`
      r IS A `The readings section 14 is applied under`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the contribution of one whose computed amount may be nothing, for` p `with` f `under` r MEANS
    LET amount MEANS `the contribution under section 14(b) or (c) for` p `with` f `under` r
    IN IF   NOT (`the income the contribution is taken on, for` p `with` f `under` r EQUALS 0)
            OR NOT (amount EQUALS 0)
       THEN amount
       ELSE CONSIDER r's `computed amount of nothing`
            WHEN `decline where the readings differ` THEN
                REFUSE "section 14(f) catches an insured person for whom nothing is payable under (b) to (e1), and the text does not say whether a computed amount of nothing is that; the readings give different contributions"
            WHEN `a computed amount of nothing is an amount payable, so (f) does not apply` THEN 0
            WHEN `a computed amount of nothing is no amount payable, so (f) applies` THEN f's `the minimum amount`

-- src:291 | ”סכום המינימום“ – סכום של 47 שקלים חדשים לחודש [note: (נכון לשנת 1995, בשנת 2026, 123 ש״ח)] שיעודכן החל ביום כ״ט בטבת התשנ״ה (1 בינואר 1995), במועדים ובשיעורים שבהם מתעדכנות קיצבאות כמשמעותן בחוק הביטוח הלאומי, לפי סעיף 2 לחוק האמור;
-- src:296 | (ב)(1) מעביד חייב לשלם למוסד דמי ביטוח בריאות בעד כל עובד מעובדיו שהוא מבוטח ושהמעביד חייב בתשלום דמי ביטוח לאומי בעדו, בשיעור של 5.17% [note: (עד ועד בכלל 2024, 5%; בינואר 2025, 5.16%)] מהכנסת העובד; המעביד ינכה את דמי ביטוח הבריאות משכרו של העובד.
-- src:314 | (ו) מבוטח שאין משתלמים בעדו דמי ביטוח בריאות לפי סעיפים קטנים (ב) עד (ה1) או (ו1), חייב לשלם דמי ביטוח בריאות בסכום המינימום.
@ref National Health Insurance Law s 14(a), (b) to (g1) (source lines 291-318)
GIVEN p IS A `A person's month under section 14`
      f IS A `The figures section 14 reads for a year`
      r IS A `The readings section 14 is applied under`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the health insurance contribution for` p `with` f `under` r MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the year is one this row answers` (p's `year`)) THEN
            REFUSE "this row answers contribution months from January 2026; the text before then (the rates of 5% and 5.16%, the reduced rate of the regulation) is not in the deposited sources"
        IF NOT (p's `year` EQUALS f's `year`) THEN
            REFUSE "the figures are for another year than the month"
        IF p's `month` LESS THAN 1 OR p's `month` GREATER THAN 12 THEN
            REFUSE "the month is not a month of the year"
        IF `section 14(g) or (g1) exempts the person` (p's `exemptions`) THEN 0
        IF NOT (p's `old-age pension` EQUALS `no old-age pension`) THEN
            `the contribution of a person who is paid an old-age pension, for` p `with` f `under` r
        OTHERWISE
            CONSIDER p's `kind`
            WHEN `an employee for whom the employer is liable for National Insurance contributions` THEN
                `the contribution of one whose computed amount may be nothing, for` p `with` f `under` r
            WHEN `an employee who is liable for National Insurance contributions himself because the employer is not` THEN
                `the contribution of one whose computed amount may be nothing, for` p `with` f `under` r
            WHEN `a self-employed person who is liable for National Insurance contributions himself` THEN
                `the contribution of one whose computed amount may be nothing, for` p `with` f `under` r
            WHEN `an insured person who is neither an employee nor a self-employed person liable for National Insurance contributions himself` THEN
                `the contribution under section 14(b) or (c) for` p `with` f `under` r
            WHEN `one who is paid an early pension, a retirement grant or an adjustment allowance` THEN
                `the contribution of one paid an early pension, for` p `with` f `under` r
            WHEN `an insured person for whom nothing is payable under section 14(b) to (e1) or (f1)` THEN
                f's `the minimum amount`
